# What stays off GitHub (the user's call, 2026-11-25: code and
# manuals public, book material private).

# ---- the books and their working notes ----
chapters/
GETTING-STARTED/
*.indd
OUTLINE.*
CHAPTER-NOTES.*
MANUALS-MAP.*
HANDOFF.*
STATUS.*
BBASIC.*
# the internal index points at the book; GitHub shows
# .github/README.md instead
/README.md
/README.txt

# ---- generated copies ----
# the root .txt files are CR-ended copies of the .md files for
# the Apple (tools/md2txt.js); MEMMAP.txt is an original
/*.txt
!/MEMMAP.txt

# ---- build output and test leftovers ----
build/
tools/emu/*.png
tools/emu/*-stage/
tools/emu/print-*.txt
*.po
*.dsk
*.2mg
